    "detailed_description": "Lands of Koastalia is a relaxing city building game with a unique building system. As Mayor, your primary mission is to keep people happy. Craft natural-looking villages, manage resources within and across them, explore an island, and meet the needs of your residents.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique building system</h2><br>The game offers you to settle on a uniquely generated enchanting island. You will find a creative building system that is based on an irregular grid and allows you to build natural looking villages.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748140/extras/2c373ea50e439e20da3fe0f7a46c1463.poster.avif?t=1748540393\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748140/extras/2c373ea50e439e20da3fe0f7a46c1463.webm?t=1748540393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748140/extras/2c373ea50e439e20da3fe0f7a46c1463.mp4?t=1748540393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You can literally create different buildings by just drawing shapes on the grid. Our special building algorithms will generate a unique building each time, bringing an element of visual charm to your village.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Great for relaxation</h2><br>The game has a huge focus on its visual part. It\u2019s very pleasant not only to build a great city, manage resources, automate things, but also to just relax and draw your village like a painting on an island as a canvas.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748140/extras/096552e9785cb1e031c844eac2b198e7.poster.avif?t=1748540393\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748140/extras/096552e9785cb1e031c844eac2b198e7.webm?t=1748540393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748140/extras/096552e9785cb1e031c844eac2b198e7.mp4?t=1748540393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resources Management</h2><br>While your population grows their needs become more and more complex. Build production chains in order to fulfill all the needs of your residents.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748140/extras/52a4016fcb81a05a13817b326c26d7f3.poster.avif?t=1748540393\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748140/extras/52a4016fcb81a05a13817b326c26d7f3.webm?t=1748540393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748140/extras/52a4016fcb81a05a13817b326c26d7f3.mp4?t=1748540393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Strategically settle villages around different resources, and manage production and supplies to thrive in this tranquil and visually captivating world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty Levels</h2><br>We like both relaxing experience and resource management challenges, so the game will have different difficulty levels to meet those two worlds.",
    "about_the_game": "Lands of Koastalia is a relaxing city building game with a unique building system. As Mayor, your primary mission is to keep people happy. Craft natural-looking villages, manage resources within and across them, explore an island, and meet the needs of your residents.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique building system</h2><br>The game offers you to settle on a uniquely generated enchanting island. You will find a creative building system that is based on an irregular grid and allows you to build natural looking villages.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748140/extras/2c373ea50e439e20da3fe0f7a46c1463.poster.avif?t=1748540393\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748140/extras/2c373ea50e439e20da3fe0f7a46c1463.webm?t=1748540393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748140/extras/2c373ea50e439e20da3fe0f7a46c1463.mp4?t=1748540393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You can literally create different buildings by just drawing shapes on the grid. Our special building algorithms will generate a unique building each time, bringing an element of visual charm to your village.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Great for relaxation</h2><br>The game has a huge focus on its visual part. It\u2019s very pleasant not only to build a great city, manage resources, automate things, but also to just relax and draw your village like a painting on an island as a canvas.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748140/extras/096552e9785cb1e031c844eac2b198e7.poster.avif?t=1748540393\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748140/extras/096552e9785cb1e031c844eac2b198e7.webm?t=1748540393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748140/extras/096552e9785cb1e031c844eac2b198e7.mp4?t=1748540393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resources Management</h2><br>While your population grows their needs become more and more complex. Build production chains in order to fulfill all the needs of your residents.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748140/extras/52a4016fcb81a05a13817b326c26d7f3.poster.avif?t=1748540393\" width=600 height=188 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748140/extras/52a4016fcb81a05a13817b326c26d7f3.webm?t=1748540393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748140/extras/52a4016fcb81a05a13817b326c26d7f3.mp4?t=1748540393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Strategically settle villages around different resources, and manage production and supplies to thrive in this tranquil and visually captivating world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty Levels</h2><br>We like both relaxing experience and resource management challenges, so the game will have different difficulty levels to meet those two worlds.",
